			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750090601,
					"content": "战果如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090602,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}找到了这个…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090603,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090604,
					"content": "让我看看…是不少见但难得的物件。保存完整，燃素流经的纹路也清晰可见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090605,
					"content": "嗯。如果我出一万摩拉的话，你们愿意把这个东西交给我吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090606,
					"content": "欸？！难道我们真的找到了价值连城的珍贵龙遗物？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090607,
					"content": "#我就知道{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是个了不起的小家伙，能给我们带来好运！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090608,
					"content": "不，这东西并没有你想的那么珍贵。拿去龙遗物研究协会总部鉴定的话，根据我的判断，充其量也就值五千摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090609,
					"content": "我才不会上当呢，要是它真的只值五千摩拉，你又怎么会出一万收购？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090610,
					"content": "因为我很中意它独特的纹路。虽然它在别人眼中没有那么高的价值，但我愿意为了得到它而花费额外的金钱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090611,
					"content": "可以说是怪癖，也可以说是收藏家的本性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090612,
					"content": "唔…这么说好像也不是不能理解。而且相比三百摩拉的进场费，一万摩拉也相当多了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090613,
					"content": "那我们要用它换一万摩拉吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090614,
					"content": "呜…呜呜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090615,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}看起来不愿意的样子…是想自己留着吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090616,
					"content": "唔…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090617,
						750090618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090617,
					"content": "#毕竟是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}自己找到的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750090619,
					"content": "#既然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}不愿意，那我们还是自己留着好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090620,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090621,
					"content": "#看来你们是看重{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}更甚摩拉了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亚"
				},
				{
